su-/usr/var/adm/sendmail-95> diff sendmail.cf.org sendmail.cf
380c380
< R$*<@$+>$*            $:$1<@$[$2$]>$3                 canon'ize complex name
s
---
> #R$*<@$+>$*           $:$1<@$[$2$]>$3                 canon'ize complex name
s
476a477
> R$-                   $@$1<@$N>                       user@domain

