The problem was the someone had ran secsetup and switch security to enhanced 
and after that system crash Since security was changed to enhanced system came 
up with enhanced security mode and NCD won't get login prompt.  It also  forced 
us to change all password on the system.

Nothing was changed on NCD nor on Alpha. I checked all files unde 
/usr/lib/X11/xdm. Finally I called NCD and Dec. Dec was able to help me with the
problem.

