Subject: Re: sar on Digital UNIX

Hi,

> Has anyone installed sar on Digital UNIX ?  Appreciate if someone can
> guide me to the ftp site containing the source code for sar which can be
> compiled and installed on Digital UNIX.
>
> Is it necessary to install SysV on the Digital UNIX in order to compile 
sar ?

sar *IS* included in the System V environement subsets. If you are using
BSD print spooling system (default: lpr/lpq/lpd) and you want to install
SysV, be sure not to install the Printing Services, otherwise the whole
printing subsystem will be switched to SysV (lpsched/lp/models/...) unless
of course you want to do that on purpose.

Hope this helps
